RIM3 dm3 pm3 {{R-OPAMP-IN-3}}
R1M3 vrefm mm3 {{R1-3}}
R2M3 mm3 om3 {{R2-3}}
XM3 pm3 mm3 p12 n12 om3 OPAx197
ROM3 om3 jm3 {{R-OUT-PROT-3}}
CFM3 jm3 agj {{C-FILT-MOD-3}}
