*
* ============================ THE PLUG ============================
* J-UMB's contacts: every one but +12 V on `plug`, +12 V on `pplug`
SP1 i1 j1 plug 0 SPLUGM
SP2 i2 j2 plug 0 SPLUGM
SP3 i3 j3 pplug 0 SPLUGM
SP4 i4 j4 plug 0 SPLUGM
SP5 i5 j5 plug 0 SPLUGM
