*
* ============================ THE INSTRUMENT ============================
* J-UMB's +12 V node: D-TVS-PWR's capacitance, and Q-INRUSH with its gate network
* (power-entry-instrument/sim's models)
CTVSP j3 tvs1 {{c_tvs_pwr}}
RTVSP tvs1 ig {{r_tvs}}
MQ ins gq j3 j3 QINRUSH
CQGS gq j3 {{c_iss_q}}
CQGD gq ins {{c_rss_q}}
DQB ins j3 DQBODY
RIGS j3 gq {{R-INRUSH-GS}}
RIG gq ig {{R-INRUSH-G}}
CIGS j3 gq {{C-INRUSH-GS}}
CIGD gq gdm {{C-INRUSH-GD}}
RIGD gdm ins {{R-INRUSH-GD}}
DRST ig gq DRESET
* INST_POS12: C-STRIP-BULK; the LED row (thirteen WS2815B-V1 and their C-LED, as one: the
* row's current, blank to lit as ledctl, on smoothly above v_led_on so it is a load)
* returning across the plane to J-UMB; L-BUCK-IN, C-BUCK-IN and the buck, a constant power
* above its input minimum
CSTRIP ins cs1 {{C-STRIP-BULK}}
RCSTRIP cs1 ig {{esr_strip}}
CLEDS ins ledg {{c_led_row}}
BLEDR ins ledg I = ({{i_row_blank}} + ({{i_row_full}} - {{i_row_blank}}) * V(ledctl)) * 0.5 * (1 + tanh((V(ins, ledg) - {{v_led_on}}) / 0.3))
RLEDR ledg ig {{r_plane}}
LBIN ins lb1 {{L-BUCK-IN}}
RLBIN lb1 cb {{r_lbin}}
CBUCK cb cb1 {{C-BUCK-IN}}
RCBUCK cb1 ig {{esr_buck}}
BBUCK cb ig I = {{p_buck}} / max(V(cb, ig), 1) * 0.5 * (1 + tanh((V(cb, ig) - {{v_on}}) / 0.1))
* the buck's output as the Matrix's 3V3 (on with the buck): the pads' rail and R-CS-PULL-INST's
BON on5 ig V = 0.5 * (1 + tanh((V(cb, ig) - {{v_on}}) / 0.1))
BV33 v33 ig V = {{vdd}} * V(on5, ig)
* the excitation (breath-excitation-reference): R-REF-IN and C-REF-OUT on REF_VIN; the
* REF5050 BEHAVIOURAL (its line regulation, on smoothly past its dropout, its output
* resistance); U-BUF half A
* (TI's OPA2197) driving VS through R-ISO-REF with R-FB-REF, R-FBX-REF and C-FB-REF
RRIN2 ins refvin {{R-REF-IN}}
CRVIN refvin ag {{C-REF-OUT-VIN}}
CDVIN refvin ag {{C-DEC-REF-VIN}}
RQREF refvin ag {{r_q_ref}}
BREF r5i ag V = ({{v_ref}} + {{k_line}} * (V(refvin, ag) - {{v_refin_nom}})) * 0.5 * (1 + tanh((V(refvin, ag) - {{v_ref}} - {{v_do_ref}} - 0.5) / 0.15))
RROUT r5i ref5v {{r_ref_out}}
CROUT ref5v crn1 {{C-REF-OUT-VOUT}}
RCROUT crn1 ag {{esr_cref}}
CDVOUT ref5v ag {{C-DEC-REF-VOUT}}
CDBUF ins ag {{C-DEC-BUF}}
XBUFA ref5v refminus ins ag bufout OPAx197
RFX bufout acmid {{R-FBX-REF}}
CFR acmid refminus {{C-FB-REF}}
RFR vs refminus {{R-FB-REF}}
RISO bufout vs {{R-ISO-REF}}
CDS vs ag {{C-DEC-SENSOR}}
* the sensor (breath-sense-link), BEHAVIOURAL: ratiometric with VS at the held pressure (a
* linear VCVS), its supply current a resistance from VS to its own pin 3; NXP's Figure 3 capacitors; U-BUF half B
* following SENSOR_RAW; R1 onto BREATH, R1b from pin 3 onto AGND_SENSE; D-TVS-BREATH to
* the plane at J-UMB
CVSB vs sg {{C-SENSOR-VS-BULK}}
CVSH vs sg {{C-SENSOR-VS-HF}}
RSENS vs sg {{r_sensor}}
ESO sro sg vs sg {{k_sensor}}
RSO sro sraw {{r_sens_out}}
CSO sraw sg {{C-SENSOR-OUT}}
XBUFB sraw sbo ins ag sbo OPAx197
RR1 sbo j1 {{R1}}
RR1B sg j2 {{R1b}}
DTVS1 ig j1 DTVSB
DTVS2 ig j2 DTVSB
* AGND_INST, an island: the sensor's pin 3 to the reference block, to NT-AGND under the
* ADC, and the plane from there to J-UMB
RISL1 sg ag {{r_isl}}
RISL2 ag atie {{r_isl}}
RPLA atie ig {{r_plane}}
* the SPI pads (carrier): IO35/IO36/IO34 behind r_drv (or high-impedance, pad_hiz), each
* pad's ESD clamps to 3V3 and to ground, U-TVS-SPI on the pad side, R-SPI-SER and the
* trace to J-UMB; R-CS-PULL-INST to 3V3 on IO34
BPS pads ig V = V(v33, ig) * V(sclkctl)
RDS pads as {{r_drv_eff}}
DCHS as v33 DPAD
DCLS ig as DPAD
CTSS as ig {{c_tvs}}
RSS as j4 {{R-SPI-SER-SCLK}}
CIS j4 ig {{c_inst}}
BPM padm ig V = V(v33, ig) * V(mosictl)
RDM padm am {{r_drv_eff}}
DCHM am v33 DPAD
DCLM ig am DPAD
CTSM am ig {{c_tvs}}
RSM am j5 {{R-SPI-SER-MOSI}}
CIM j5 ig {{c_inst}}
BPC padc ig V = V(v33, ig) * V(csctl)
RDC padc ac {{r_drv_eff}}
RCSPI ac v33 {{R-CS-PULL-INST}}
DCHC ac v33 DPAD
DCLC ig ac DPAD
CTSC ac ig {{c_tvs}}
RSC ac j7 {{R-SPI-SER-CS}}
CIC j7 ig {{c_inst}}
*
* ============================ MODELS ============================
.model D5817 D(Is={{d_is}} N={{d_n}} Rs={{d_rs}} Cjo=110p BV=20)
.model DLTL D(Is={{led_is}} N={{led_n}} Rs={{led_rs}})
.model DCLAMP D(Is={{is_d}} N={{n_d}} Rs={{rs_d}} Cjo=1.5p)
.model DRESP D(IS={{is_d}} N={{n_d}} RS={{rs_d}} CJO=1.5p)
.model DTVSB D(Is=1e-14 Cjo={{cj_sig}} Vj={{tvs_vj}} M={{tvs_m}} BV={{tvs_bv}})
.model DPAD D(Is=1e-14 N=1)
.model QPASS NMOS(level=1 vto={{v_th}} kp={{kp}})
.model QINRUSH PMOS(level=1 vto={{vto_q}} kp={{kp_q}})
.model DQBODY D(is={{is_body_q}} n=1)
.model DRESET D(is={{is_rst}} n={{n_rst}})
.model SPLUGM SW(vt=0.5 vh=0.1 ron=1m roff=1e9)
.model SHOLD SW(vt=0.5 vh=0.1 ron={{r_hold}} roff=1e12)
.ends SYS
